description:
Travel through different seas, catch fish in a variety of magical places.

In our game, very many unique bodies of water.

Game features:

- more than 100 kinds of fish;
- a lot of unique water bodies;
- cool fishing gear;
- various tasks;
- aquariums where you can grow and sell fish.

World Wars Tanks is a free online tactical tank arcade game dedicated to the major battles of World War II. Kpfw. IV; and the American M Sherman, M, M Lee, and others.
Choose one of four main factions:
USSR – durable and widely produced tanks with excellent cross-country ability;
Germany – powerful armor and highly accurate guns;
USA – balanced vehicles with good mobility and reliability.
UK – heavy armor and powerful guns.

Ready for a challenging puzzle that tests your logic and tactics? Welcome to "2048 Puzzle: Connect the Balls"! 
Game Features:
Aim and shoot balls to connect;
Use bombs to clear balls;
Score points, set records, and outplay others!
Spend your time wisely and show off your intellectual skills in "2048 Puzzle: Connect the Balls"!
